\newlabel{fig:trajectories}{{6}{8}{Cumulative domain exposure fraction trajectories for the top-5 and bottom-5 variance domains across all 154 training checkpoints. High-variance domains show monotonic but non-uniform growth; zero-variance domains are flat at 0.0}{figure.6}{}}
